.TH CLIENT 1 "September 2026" "BSDSF24A027" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- demonstrates the myutils string and file utility library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is a driver program that tests the functions provided by the
.B myutils
library, including string manipulation (mystrlen, mystrcpy, mystrncpy, mystrcat)
and file utilities (wordCount, mygrep). It reads from
.I test.txt
in the current directory and prints the results of each function call.
